sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CTC as CTC Office
    participant H as Central Harness
    participant M as SwTrackController
    participant W as TrackController (wayside)
    CTC-->>H: return closed_blocks, SwitchCommand(line, switch, position) (its STEP reply)
    Note right of CTC: Switch commands are sent only in maintenance mode. There is no mode flag.
    H->>H: ctc_to_track_controller internal: closures and commands keyed by block
    H->>M: step(dt, inputs.ctc)
    Note over H,M: step reaches SwTrackController through TrackControllerProcess.step and TrackControllerState.step (SD-09).
    M->>M: step internal: maintenance := a command is in effect on a switch it governs
    loop each wayside (_apply)
        opt maintenance changed
            M->>W: set_maintenance(active)
            W->>W: set_maintenance internal: on ending, clear manual_switches and ctc_switch_commands
        end
        M->>W: set_closed(block, closed), for each block
        M->>W: set_ctc_switch_command(switch, reverse or None)
    end
    Note right of W: build_scan_inputs gives the PLC CLOSED_n and MAINT, and the vital code CTCCMD_s and CTCREV_s.
